#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:197
msgid "Delay third-party tracking & chat scripts until first interaction"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:198
msgid "Browser caching & compression for images, fonts and text (Apache)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:199
msgid "Skip the Dashicons font for logged-out visitors"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:200
msgid "Weekly cleanup of expired transients in the database"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:213
msgid "Minifies your CSS and JavaScript files and serves cached copies from the uploads folder — originals are never modified, and anything already minified is skipped"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:217
msgid "Minifies the HTML WordPress sends to the browser — strips comments and collapses redundant whitespace, leaving <pre>, <textarea> and script payloads untouched"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:221
msgid "Removes ?ver= from CSS and JS URLs for logged-out visitors so CDNs and proxies cache them. A file keeps its version tag for 7 days after it changes, and logged-in editors always get the tagged URL, so updates and edits are never hidden"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:225
msgid "Adds loading=\"lazy\" and decoding=\"async\" to images and iframes that don't have it. The first two images stay eager (they are usually the largest paint), and gallery, slider and already-lazy images are left alone"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:229
msgid "Adds defer to stand-alone scripts in the page head that nothing else depends on. jQuery, WordPress core, WooCommerce, page builders, sliders and galleries are never deferred"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:233
msgid "Delays third-party tracking, advertising and chat scripts (Google Analytics/Tag Manager, Meta Pixel, Hotjar, Intercom, Tawk.to and similar) until the first interaction or 7 seconds — your theme, WooCommerce and page-builder scripts always load normally, so layouts and galleries are never affected"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:237
msgid "Removes the emoji-detection script & inline CSS WordPress prints on every page (frontend and wp-admin)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:241
msgid "Drops unused <link> tags from <head> (RSD, WLW manifest, shortlink, generator tag, REST API and oEmbed discovery links)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:245
msgid "Turns PHP OPcache on if your host has it available but left it off"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:249
msgid "Raises wp-admin's memory_limit and max_execution_time headroom (never below what your host already allows) so heavy builders like Divi/Elementor are less likely to hit a slow or failed save — frontend visitor requests are never touched"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:253
msgid "Caps the Heartbeat API to once every 60 seconds in wp-admin (instead of every 15–60s) and removes it from the frontend entirely for visitors — fewer background requests hitting the server on both sides"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:257
msgid "Caps stored post revisions at 5 per post going forward (older ones already saved are left alone) — keeps the posts table smaller and post-related queries a little faster on both the editor and the frontend"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:261
msgid "Stops WordPress from pinging itself when one of your own posts links to another — removes a pointless outbound HTTP request and a comments-table write on every such save"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:265
msgid "Disables XML-RPC entirely (removes unused remote publishing protocol that most modern sites don't need) — eliminates brute-force attack vectors and unused server load"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:269
msgid "Increases autosave interval from 60 to 120 seconds in wp-admin — fewer database writes and server calls while editing"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:273
msgid "Adds compression (gzip) and long-lived browser caching for images, fonts and video to your .htaccess on Apache — fewer bytes and fewer requests on every repeat visit. CSS and JS keep WordPress's own versioning, so updates always show immediately. Skipped automatically on Nginx or when .htaccess isn't writable"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:277
msgid "Stops loading the Dashicons icon font for logged-out visitors unless a stylesheet on the page actually depends on it"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:281
msgid "Deletes expired transients from the options table once a week — without an object cache they pile up and slow down every options query"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:285
msgid "Stops wp-embed.min.js from loading on the frontend for visitors — it only resizes embedded-post iframes, which most sites never use, so it's one less script on every page"
msgstr ""

#: includes/extensions/class-reloadify-speed.php:289
msgid "Serves this plugin's own CSS/JS pre-minified on real requests (roughly half the bytes) — automatic, and only switches back to the readable originals when SCRIPT_DEBUG or WP_DEBUG is on, so nothing changes for local development"
msgstr ""

